# Test-project configuration, loaded by playwright.config.ts.
#
# A DELIBERATELY LOW SUPABASE CAP (docs/28 §10, CP-34).
# PostgREST's max-rows is 1,000 by default and no fixture is ever that big, so a read that is
# unsafe only once the table grows passes every test forever. At 50, a fixture of fifty-one
# rows exposes it. The approved keyset helper terminates only on an EMPTY page, so lowering the
# cap cannot make correct pagination truncate - the unit spec proves that at a page size above it.
PUBLIC_SUPABASE_MAX_ROWS=50
